{
  "skill": "helix-cad-ingest",
  "mode": "accuracy",
  "description": "Accuracy eval — runs the real ingest.py on a self-generated DXF fixture with known ground truth and grades extracted values against a golden Q&A set. Verifies the HARNESS (query resolver + provenance check); the CEO authors the real 40-50 Q&A set on the GIÁ TRƯỢT set using fixtures/GOLDEN_QA_TEMPLATE.md.",
  "fixture": {
    "generator": "fixtures/gen_fixture_dxf.py",
